      "body": "Fixture E11 (review writes): Lo's recordings of comments, replies and reviews are written here as rozed-bot, which can only comment on its own pull request. `e11/review.txt` changes lines 10, 11, 30 and 50, so the diff has three hunks with lines outside them, and `e11/notes.md` changes one line, for file-level comments. The recordings delete the comments they can afterwards; submitted reviews stay. It targets `e11/base`, which adds the files it changes to `main`. Made by `script/e2e/fixtures.sh` in scornz/lo.",
